<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46395" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωγρᾰφ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>paint from life, paint</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				598b
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				434b
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδοναὶ . . ἐζωγραφημέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					40b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνείρους ζ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Chr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>adorn with paint</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ληκύθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					996
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὀφρῦς ἀσβόλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					98.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> generally,
				<i>adorn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆπον σὺν τοῖς φυτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
					2.449
				</span></i>
			.</div>
